This loop continues until the implementation reaches production-quality quality.

---

# 14. AFTER A FIX

When the Coding Agent implements an edit:

1. Detect the new completion in `check.md`.
2. Reinspect the affected area.
3. Verify the issue is actually fixed.
4. Check for regressions.
5. If fixed, do nothing further.
6. If still broken, create/update an edit describing the remaining issue.

Do NOT mark something fixed simply because code changed.

---

