Before reviewing a completed task:

1. Read agents/state.json.
2. Identify the PLAN-ID and CHECK-ID.
3. If this exact implementation has already been reviewed and approved, DO NOT review it again unless the project changed afterward.
4. Record a unique CHECK-ID for every review.
5. Every discovered problem must receive a unique EDIT-ID.
6. Never create duplicate edits for the same unresolved issue.
